  "<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><thead><tr><th>$x(t)$ ($t>0$)</th><th>$X(s)$</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>$\\delta(t)$</td><td>$1$</td></tr><tr><td>$u_{-1}(t)$</td><td>$1/s$</td></tr><tr><td>$t$</td><td>$1/s^2$</td></tr><tr><td>$t^n/n!$</td><td>$1/s^{n+1}$</td></tr><tr><td>$e^{-at}$</td><td>$1/(s+a)$</td></tr><tr><td>$te^{-at}$</td><td>$1/(s+a)^2$</td></tr><tr><td>$\\cos\\omega t$</td><td>$s/(s^2+\\omega^2)$</td></tr><tr><td>$\\sin\\omega t$</td><td>$\\omega/(s^2+\\omega^2)$</td></tr><tr><td>$e^{-at}\\cos\\omega t$</td><td>$(s+a)/((s+a)^2+\\omega^2)$</td></tr><tr><td>$e^{-at}\\sin\\omega t$</td><td>$\\omega/((s+a)^2+\\omega^2)$</td></tr></tbody></table></div>",
  "Un segnale a tratti si scrive con gradini ritardati: l'impulso rettangolare $A[u_{-1}(t)-u_{-1}(t-T)]$ ha trasformata $A\\,\\dfrac{1-e^{-sT}}{s}$."
 ],
