  {
   "titolo": "Trasformata di $e^{-at}$ e del coseno",
   "passi": [
    "$\\int_0^\\infty e^{-at}e^{-st}dt=\\left[-\\dfrac{e^{-(s+a)t}}{s+a}\\right]_0^\\infty=\\dfrac{1}{s+a}$ (per $\\mathrm{Re}\\,s>-a$).",
    "$\\cos\\omega t=\\tfrac12(e^{j\\omega t}+e^{-j\\omega t})$: $\\mathcal L=\\tfrac12\\left(\\dfrac1{s-j\\omega}+\\dfrac1{s+j\\omega}\\right)=\\dfrac{s}{s^2+\\omega^2}$. $\\square$"
   ]
  }
 ],
